{"version":1,"key":"card:283","content":{"id":283,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数组的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"slice","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法是对数组内的元素进行拷贝，然后返回一个新的数组，该方法接收两个参数，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"begin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"end","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示拷贝的起始位置和终止位置，这两个参数都是可选的，如果默认没有传入参数的话，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"begin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的默认值是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"end","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 默认表示拷贝到数组的最后一个元素"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const arr = [\"red\", \"green\", \"blue\"];\n\nconst newArr = arr.slice(0, 2);\nconsole.log(newArr);                  // [ 'red', 'green' ]\nconsole.log(newArr instanceof Array); // true","language":"js","uuid":"f77cc042-2ddb-4609-8c2c-bbb2b254ba5e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"slice","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回的是一个数组，它是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Array","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型的实例，现在如果我们自定义类 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"MyArray","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 继承 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Array","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类，调用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"slice","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"class MyArray extends Array {}\n\nlet arr = new MyArray();\narr.push(...[\"red\", \"green\", \"blue\"]);\n\nlet newArr = arr.slice();\nconsole.log(newArr instanceof MyArray); // true\nconsole.log(newArr instanceof Array);   // true","language":"js","uuid":"a5aa4041-bb3e-46c4-8d71-185eb77b184e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"slice","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法返回的是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"MyArray","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的实例，而不是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Array","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 实例，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"slice","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法返回的是谁的实例是由 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Symbol.species","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性决定的。如果在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"MyArray","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中添加了一个静态方法 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"[Symbol.species]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它返回的值是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Array","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"slice","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法返回的就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Array","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的实例。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"class MyArray extends Array {\n  static get [Symbol.species]() {\n    return Array;\n  }\n}\n\nconst arr = new MyArray();\narr.push(...[\"red\", \"green\", \"blue\"]);\n\nconst newArr = arr.slice();\nconsole.log(newArr instanceof MyArray); // false\nconsole.log(newArr instanceof Array);   // true","language":"js","uuid":"8338e7c1-c564-45b8-8482-1520528504a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"],"createTime":1692112889770,"updateTime":1744034543055,"linkedCards":[{"id":249,"target":{"key":"card:249","type":"card","id":249},"summary":"Symbol 是 ES6 引入的一种新的原始类型，类型的值唯一的，每个被创建出来的 Symbol 变量都是不同的，这是 Symbol 这种数据类型最大的特点，常常用于作为对象的属性，以防止被不正确篡改。 Symbol 不能通过字面量来进行创...","tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"]},{"id":276,"target":{"key":"card:276","type":"card","id":276},"summary":"JavaScript 不同于 Java、C++ 等典型的面向对象语言，JavaScript 在过去并没有类的概念，所以一些从 Java 或 C++ 等其他面向语言转过来的开发者会感到困惑，所以在 ES6 中引入了类的概念。 使用关键字 cl...","tags":["JavaScript/类"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1744034543055}}